{"t":"BAC","made":"2026-11-28 02:27","name":"Bank of America Corporation","ko":"뱅크오브아메리카","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Diversified","employees":210000,"hq":"Charlotte, NC, United States","website":"https://www.bankofamerica.com","summary_en":"Bank of America Corporation, through its subsidiaries, provides various financial products and services for individual consumers, small and middle-market businesses, institutional investors, large corporations, and governments worldwide. It operates through four segments: Consumer Banking, Global Wealth & Investment Management (GWIM), Global Banking, and Global Markets. The Consumer Banking segment offers traditional and money market savings accounts, certificates of deposit and IRAs, checking accounts, and investment accounts and products; credit and debit cards; residential mortgages and home equity loans; and direct and indirect loans. The GWIM segment provides investment management, brokerage, banking, and trust and retirement products and services; wealth management solutions; and customized solutions, including specialty asset management services. The Global Banking segment offers lending products and services, including commercial loans, leases, commitment facilities, trade finance, and commercial real estate and asset-based lending; treasury solutions, and underwriting and advisory services. The Global Markets segment provides market-making, financing, securities clearing, settlement, and custody services; securities and derivative products; and risk management products using interest rate, equity, credit, currency and commodity derivatives, foreign exchange, fixed-income, and mortgage-related products. Bank of America Corporation was founded in 1784 and is based in Charlotte, North Carolina.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Bank of America Corporation은 자회사를 통해 전 세계 개인 소비자, 중소기업, 기관 투자자, 대기업 및 정부를 대상으로 다양한 금융 상품과 서비스를 제공합니다. 소비자 금융, 글로벌 자산 및 투자 관리(GWIM), 글로벌 뱅킹, 글로벌 시장 등 4개 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 소비자 금융 부문은 전통적 및 머니 마켓 저축 계좌, 예금 증서 및 IRA, 당좌 예금 계좌, 투자 계좌 및 상품을 제공합니다. 신용카드 및 직불카드; 주택 모기지 및 주택 담보 대출; 그리고 직접 및 간접 대출. GWIM 부문은 투자 관리, 중개, 은행, 신탁 및 퇴직 상품과 서비스를 제공합니다. 자산 관리 솔루션; 전문 자산관리 서비스를 포함한 맞춤형 솔루션을 제공합니다. 글로벌 뱅킹 부문은 상업용 대출, 임대, 약정 시설, 무역 금융, 상업용 부동산 및 자산 기반 대출을 포함한 대출 상품 및 서비스를 제공합니다. 재무 솔루션, 인수 및 자문 서비스를 제공합니다. 글로벌 시장 부문은 시장 조성, 자금 조달, 증권 청산, 결제 및 보관 서비스를 제공합니다. 증권 및 파생상품; 금리, 주식, 신용, 통화 및 상품 파생상품, 외환, 채권, 주택담보대출 관련 상품 등을 활용한 리스크 관리 상품 등이 있습니다. Bank of America Corporation은 1784년에 설립되었으며 노스캐롤라이나 주 샬럿에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":49.16,"mcap":339214270464.0,"pe":11.732697,"fpe":9.490165,"peg":0.8567,"ps":2.952899,"pb":1.2523245,"ev_ebitda":null,"div":2.64,"beta":1.192,"hi52":65.23,"lo52":46.12},"fin":{"rev":114874998784.0,"rev_g":0.034,"eps_g":-0.125,"gross":0.0,"op":0.35306,"net":0.28064,"roe":0.1073,"fcf":null,"cash":820671021056.0,"debt":759198973952.0,"de":null,"eps":4.19,"feps":5.1801},"own":{"short":0.0,"inst":0.71742994,"insider":0.067329995},"analyst":{"n":22,"mean":62.47727,"median":62.0,"high":71.0,"low":56.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.48,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":6,"buy":16,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":6,"buy":16,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":6,"buy":15,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":5,"buy":15,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":62.0,"priorPriceTarget":67.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":59.5,"priorPriceTarget":62.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-15","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":60.0,"priorPriceTarget":66.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-15","Firm":"Morgan Stan